WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.802
A small model on your Mac. Nothing leaves it.

00:02.802 --> 00:08.306
She paints a masterpiece from 30,000 squares

00:08.306 --> 00:16.315
She draws anything you can name

00:16.315 --> 00:19.818
She runs your Mac: volume, music, timers

00:19.818 --> 00:22.822
She does the math

00:22.822 --> 00:25.826
She knows the time anywhere

00:25.826 --> 00:29.034
Free. Private. Download her for Mac.
